     "body": "**WORKOUT DETAILS**\n\n**Work Duration**: 30 seconds on each exercise (based on your fitness level, the number of reps within each working time period can vary)\n\n**Transition Time:** 15 Seconds\n\n**Rest**: Up to 60 Seconds (after each completed round)\n\n**Rounds**: 3-5\n\n**Circuit:**\n\n**1. Spin Progression** (each progression below coincides with the round you are performing):\n\n1. **Open Arm Side to Side Swing w/ Rotation**\n2. **Single Side Half Spin** (15 sec each side)\n3. **Single Side Half Spin** (15 sec each side)\n4. **Single Side Half Spin** (15 sec each side)\n  - **Progression Option:** Spin and Pause (15 sec each side)\n5. **Single Side Half Spin** (15 sec each side)\n  - **Progression Option:** Spin and Pause (15 sec each side)\n\n**2. Squat**\n\n**3. Overhead Press**\n\n**4. Row - Deadlift/Stand Combo** (for every 4 Rows, perform 1 Deadlift/Stand)\n\n**5. Side Lying Leg Raises*** (30 sec each leg)\n\n- Position 1: Leg Inline with torso\n- Position 2: Hip at ~135 degrees\n- Position 3: Hip at ~90 degrees\n\n***Note:** If you perform a total of 5 rounds, in the final one (round #5), during your Side Lying Leg Raises, perform an extended set of 60 seconds on each side, rather than 30 seconds.",
